          "source": "docs/server-cores/17-akarin.md"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key_path": "world-settings.default.physics.async-entity-physics",
      "chinese_entries": [
        {
          "term": "异步实体物理",
          "context": "是否异步处理实体物理（实体移动、碰撞等）。true=多线程处理大量实体；false=原版同步。⚠️ 异步实体可能影响反作弊判定",
          "source": "docs/server-cores/17-akarin.md"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key_path": "world-settings.default.physics.max-async-tasks",
      "chinese_entries": [
        {
          "term": "最大异步任务数",
          "context": "异步物理任务队列的最大长度。值越大吞吐越高但延迟上升；值小延迟低但可能堆积任务。建议 2-8",
          "source": "docs/server-cores/17-akarin.md"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key_path": "world-settings.default.optimizations.disable-piston-physics",
      "chinese_entries": [
        {
          "term": "禁用活塞物理",
